1. Problems statement
Traffic congestion and poor traffic flow are challenges affecting transportation in Kigali City. Heavy traffic, roadside activities and traffic rule violations can contribute to delays, increased travel time and road safety problems. These conditions make it difficult for road users and traffic authorities to manage traffic effectively.

Research conducted in Kigali has examined traffic congestion, roadside friction and traffic compliance. However, there is a need for an organized system that stores traffic information, analyzes traffic patterns and provides useful information to support traffic management decisions.
